OL,3,AMore NHS staff sacked over attacks
OL,4,Avictims' records
OL,5,
OL,6,FFurther members of staff have been
OL,7,Fsacked by an NHS trust for
OL,8,Finappropriately accessing medical
OL,9,Frecords of the Nottingham attacks
OL,10,Fvictims.
OL,12,FNottingham students Barnaby Webber and
OL,13,FGrace O'Malley-Kumar, and grandfather
OL,14,FIan Coates, were stabbed to death on 13
OL,15,FJune 2023 by Valdo Calocane, who was
OL,16,Fdiagnosed with paranoid schizophrenia
OL,17,Fin 2020.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
